        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="material, obsolete" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg hydrated ethanol 95% (dry basis, i.e. 1.05 kg hydrated ethanol 95% wet basis), respectively 1 kg of DDGS (wet basis) from potatoes. The multioutput-process 'potatoes, in distillery' delivers the co-products 'ethanol, 95% in H2O, from potatoes, at distillery' and 'DDGS, from potatoes, at distillery'. Economic allocation with allocation factor for common stages of 95.6% to ethanol. Allocation is done according to carbon balance for CO2 emissions.;&#10;UUID: bfcf9653-bade-3308-9425-525456a842aa" includedProcesses="This dataset includes the transport of potatoes to the distillery, and the processing of potatoes to hydrated ethanol (95%) and DDGS (distiller&quot;s dried grains with solubles, 90% dry matter). System boundary is at the distillery. Dehydration to anhydrous ethanol is not included." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="material, obsolete" localName="xx DDGS, from potatoes, at distillery" localSubCategory="fuels, obsolete\biofuels, obsolete\ethanols\byproducts" name="xx DDGS, from potatoes, at distillery" subCategory="fuels, obsolete\biofuels, obsolete\ethanols\byproducts" unit="kg"/>
